  "windows_budget_basis": "First hosted run of the Windows partitions: Linux wall time from run 36051245663 (ubuntu-24.04-arm, 4 vCPU) x3.5, from the MSVC lane compiling the library chain beneath the root crate in 27 min against 10 on Arm (2.7x) in the same run, plus headroom. Replace with measured wall time x1.25 after the first hosted run.",
  "macos_budget_basis": "Each group's budget is measured wall time plus headroom, from run 36051245663 (macos-14, 3 vCPU, warm dependency cache) where the groups were root-lib, root-suites (sessions, journeys, transport), runtime-storage and contracts-dashboard-api: root-lib 21.7 compile + 4.3 tests; root-sessions 25.9 + 4.1; root-journeys 7.4 + 4.1 against the sessions tree; root-transport 18.2 + 12.6 against the journeys tree (test-transport re-resolves 31 workspace crates); root-dashboard-api 24.4 + 0.8 as a lone `-p tracedecay` resolution (108 dependency units and 48 workspace crates apart from every other root partition); runtime 38.8 + 5.2 and core-storage 15.3 + 2.8 with 213 dependency units missing the root cache; core-contracts 20.6 + 12.3 (one hung test, 33 s on Linux). Groups now pair partitions that share one resolution so a group compiles one chain, and the lower group carries its own dependency cache.",
  "macos_groups": [
    {
      "name": "root-lib",
      "timeout_minutes": 60,
      "budget_basis": "27.4 measured (21.7 compile + 4.3 tests + setup); the root chain, library test target and 774 tests are the lane's floor, so nothing shares this job; x1.25 = 34, kept at 60 until a second measurement"
    },
    {
      "name": "root-suites",
      "timeout_minutes": 55,
      "budget_basis": "root-sessions 30.0 + root-journeys 11.5 measured in one target directory = 41.5 (+1 setup) x1.25 = 53"
    },
    {
      "name": "root-transport",
      "timeout_minutes": 60,
      "budget_basis": "root-transport 30.8 measured against a warm journeys tree; alone it also compiles the chain beneath graph-db (~8 on this runner), then root-dashboard-api adds one test target of the same resolution (~2 + 0.8 tests): ~43 x1.25 = 54; first hosted run of this pairing, replace with measured"
    },
    {
      "name": "lower",
      "timeout_minutes": 110,
      "budget_basis": "runtime 44.0 + core-storage 18.1 + core-contracts 21.1 (tests 0.5 without the hang) = 83 measured with the dependency units missing the root cache, x1.25 = 104; warm against this group's own `ci-test-lower-macOS` cache the compiles are roughly halved; replace with measured after the first warm run"
    }
